WEBVTT

01:36.490 --> 01:41.030
Kagi Tanaka, also known as Silver KARASU the Cyber-TSUJIGIRI,

01:41.490 --> 01:43.370
happened to save Yamoto Koki's life

01:43.370 --> 01:46.580
and began to use the time he had left to teach her KARATE.

01:47.330 --> 01:53.590
But then the SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE ordered him to assassinate Yamoto.

01:55.800 --> 01:56.800
Listen up.

01:56.800 --> 01:58.220
This ain't charity.

01:58.220 --> 02:02.510
This is something I want to do,
and I'm forcing you to play along.

02:02.510 --> 02:03.310
Yeah.

02:03.310 --> 02:06.730
I don't have time to give you proper instruction.

02:06.730 --> 02:08.690
So figure out the rest yourself.

02:08.690 --> 02:09.810
Right.

02:09.810 --> 02:12.650
IAIDŌ is all about the KATANA.

02:12.650 --> 02:16.230
You pour your KARATE into your KATANA.

02:16.230 --> 02:18.700
In other words, you become the KATANA.

02:18.700 --> 02:21.070
That is the ultimate level of IAIDŌ.

02:21.070 --> 02:22.160
Right.

02:22.160 --> 02:24.870
SŌKAIYA's after you, right?

02:24.870 --> 02:29.250
Sooner or later, the next assassins will come for you.

02:29.250 --> 02:30.830
And it won't be just one.

02:30.830 --> 02:32.290
This stuff is my job.

02:33.170 --> 02:35.300
So this is the last thing I'll show you.

02:35.300 --> 02:37.300
It's an IAI like ZEN.

02:37.300 --> 02:39.680
I almost never use it.

02:39.680 --> 02:42.890
But make sure you don't forget how it feels.

02:44.100 --> 02:46.100
You need to defeat your enemy.

02:46.100 --> 02:49.350
And you... aw, stop cryin'.

02:52.440 --> 02:54.110
And then boom!

02:54.110 --> 02:55.570
What a world, huh?

02:55.570 --> 02:57.320
Stop!

02:59.190 --> 02:59.950
Hey.

03:00.200 --> 03:03.490
When things calm down, you thinking of going to KYŌTO?

03:00.200 --> 03:03.490
NOTE: KYŌTO is a PLACE.

03:03.490 --> 03:05.910
Somewhere warm, maybe?

03:05.910 --> 03:10.410
If you get out of Neo-Saitama, they might forget about you.

03:10.410 --> 03:12.460
I've got nowhere to go.

03:12.460 --> 03:13.750
Someday, you—

03:14.540 --> 03:15.960
Kagi-SAN!

03:17.340 --> 03:19.130
Shit!

03:19.130 --> 03:20.420
BUDDHA...

03:24.930 --> 03:26.050
Hey.

03:26.050 --> 03:27.680
Maybe you oughta get outta here.

03:28.560 --> 03:29.680
Can you?

03:30.390 --> 03:31.230
Yeah.

03:32.140 --> 03:33.100
Farewell.

03:38.070 --> 03:39.360
Thank you.

03:40.360 --> 03:41.570
Please...

03:46.280 --> 03:49.080
I wonder if he did it...

03:54.290 --> 03:59.090
The SŌKAIYA NINJA, Third Eye,
excelled in tracking NINJA SOULS.

03:59.590 --> 04:01.760
And the BOUNTY HUNTER, Sword Dancer,

04:01.760 --> 04:04.840
was a dangerous NINJA who had mastered NITŌRYŪ.

04:01.760 --> 04:04.840
NOTE: NITŌRYŪ is TWO-SWORD RYŪ.

04:11.390 --> 04:15.650
The target's NINJA SOUL trail splits in two here.

04:15.650 --> 04:17.810
Which is fresher?

04:17.810 --> 04:20.530
It's hard to say, actually.

04:20.940 --> 04:22.070
That's a lie!

04:22.070 --> 04:23.780
He told a lie!

04:24.280 --> 04:26.280
Let's split up.

04:26.280 --> 04:27.740
I'll take this way.

04:27.740 --> 04:29.490
You take that way.

04:29.490 --> 04:30.830
Very well.

04:30.830 --> 04:33.370
Where do we meet up with Silver KARASU?

04:33.370 --> 04:35.920
He's not responding to the notice.

04:35.920 --> 04:38.630
He may be planning to hog the bounty.

04:38.630 --> 04:39.960
That fool.

04:39.960 --> 04:42.010
In the end, she's just one girl.

04:42.010 --> 04:45.050
We'll find her first, and then it'll be all over.

04:45.050 --> 04:45.970
Go!

04:50.560 --> 04:51.890
You stray dog...

04:52.220 --> 04:54.480
Have fun wasting your time!

04:54.480 --> 04:57.730
The target left the abandoned DŌJŌ and followed this route.

04:57.730 --> 05:00.570
Then she and a helper went back to their hideout.

05:00.570 --> 05:02.650
The helper is still there now.

05:02.650 --> 05:08.530
And it could be the powerful NINJA who slew the SIX GATES, NINJA Slayer!

05:08.530 --> 05:11.490
Sword Dancer can have the one who might be dangerous.

05:11.490 --> 05:13.910
And the target will be all mine!

05:18.170 --> 05:19.130
DŌMO.

05:19.380 --> 05:21.040
I am Yamoto Koki.

05:22.750 --> 05:25.130
DŌMO, Yamoto Koki-SAN.

05:25.130 --> 05:27.050
I am Third Eye.

05:33.520 --> 05:37.440
GWAARGH!

05:38.730 --> 05:39.560
What?

05:39.560 --> 05:41.150
YEEART!

05:41.980 --> 05:44.400
DŌMO, Sword Dancer-SAN.

05:44.690 --> 05:46.030
DŌMO.

05:46.030 --> 05:48.450
Have you gone mad, Silver KARASU-SAN?

05:48.450 --> 05:50.120
Yeah, that's right.

05:50.120 --> 05:52.830
Got any cigs? My brand is Slightly Bright Sea.

05:53.370 --> 05:55.040
But I bet not.

05:55.040 --> 05:56.960
If you did, I was gonna take one...

05:57.870 --> 05:59.830
Right off your dead body.

05:59.830 --> 06:02.460
Third Eye-SAN, come in! We've been betrayed!

06:02.460 --> 06:05.210
IRC? You're wasting your time.

06:05.210 --> 06:07.800
That explosion threw CHAFF into the air.

06:05.210 --> 06:07.800
NOTE: CHAFF is separated from WHEAT.

06:08.170 --> 06:10.640
Why, Silver KARASU-SAN?

06:10.640 --> 06:13.970
I've gone mad. Not much time left, y'see?

06:14.310 --> 06:16.520
Then I must kill you?

06:16.520 --> 06:17.600
YEEART!

06:17.600 --> 06:18.890
GWAARGH!

06:22.190 --> 06:24.570
WRRYYYYY!

06:24.570 --> 06:25.610
YEEART!

06:25.610 --> 06:27.240
YEEART! YEEART! YEEART!

06:27.240 --> 06:31.200
GORAN NA! What mastery of NITŌRYŪ style!

06:31.200 --> 06:35.830
But Silver KARASU used only one sword, his UBASUTE,

06:31.200 --> 06:35.830
NOTE: UBASUTE was left by an OLD WOMAN.

06:35.830 --> 06:39.330
and his NINJA kinetic vision to fight back!

06:40.370 --> 06:40.960
YEEART!

06:40.960 --> 06:42.920
GWAAAARGGH!

06:46.920 --> 06:49.630
Say your HAIKU, Sword Dancer-SAN.

06:49.630 --> 06:51.130
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ—

06:51.130 --> 06:54.800
My NITŌRYŪ was no match for your IAIDŌ!

06:54.800 --> 06:56.720
Reborn, I shall win!

07:01.440 --> 07:02.900
SAYŌNARA!

07:07.150 --> 07:09.440
NAMU AMIDA—

07:22.670 --> 07:24.210
Surprised?

07:24.210 --> 07:26.880
Kineticists, in the end,
are simply using physics.

07:26.880 --> 07:30.420
This combination of my
NINJA SOUL with INDUSTRY

07:30.420 --> 07:34.140
makes my KARATE three times more amazing!

07:38.930 --> 07:41.690
I don't like that look on your face.

07:41.690 --> 07:42.640
I'll kill you!

07:42.640 --> 07:43.600
Try it!

07:43.600 --> 07:45.650
You've no JUTSU now, little girl!

07:46.190 --> 07:48.730
Follow the angle of the blade,
where he's looking,

07:49.110 --> 07:50.570
<i>and the way his feet point.</i>

07:51.190 --> 07:53.700
<i>NATURE can tell you many things.</i>

07:53.700 --> 07:55.120
YEEART!

07:57.580 --> 08:00.330
<i>An IAI strike is a beautiful thing.</i>

08:01.040 --> 08:04.330
<i>A beautiful strike won't just come to you.</i>

08:04.830 --> 08:06.460
<i>You must make it yourself.</i>

08:06.460 --> 08:07.040
YEEART!

08:07.040 --> 08:08.630
GWAARGH!

08:09.300 --> 08:11.260
Yamoto was shocked.

08:11.260 --> 08:15.180
The tiny sliver of instruction that Kagi Tanaka had given her

08:15.180 --> 08:19.850
taught her the methods of KARATE, and the rules of combat.

08:19.850 --> 08:21.810
Her world changed.

08:22.680 --> 08:24.480
<i>This isn't the end.</i>

08:24.480 --> 08:26.400
<i>Make it your beginning.</i>

08:26.400 --> 08:29.610
<i>You have learned the DŌ of KARATE.</i>

08:29.610 --> 08:31.860
<i>If you let yourself be satisfied with that,</i>

08:31.860 --> 08:33.190
<i>then it's the end for you.</i>

08:33.740 --> 08:35.320
YEEART!

08:40.370 --> 08:41.450
<i>Now!</i>

08:41.830 --> 08:43.370
<i>This very instant!</i>

08:44.000 --> 08:46.670
<i>This is where IAI can be found!</i>

08:46.670 --> 08:47.830
YEEART!

08:47.830 --> 08:49.790
GWWAAARRGGH!

08:49.790 --> 08:51.880
AAHH! AAAAHHHWWARAAAGH!

08:51.880 --> 08:53.880
Impossible!

08:54.170 --> 08:57.840
S-Silver KARASU-SAN, are you here yet?!

08:59.850 --> 09:02.640
SAYŌNARA!

09:08.270 --> 09:11.070
You shouldn't make a sick man hurry.

09:11.320 --> 09:12.440
DŌMO.

09:12.440 --> 09:13.740
HAJIMEMASHITE.

09:14.570 --> 09:16.400
I am Yamoto Koki.

09:16.400 --> 09:19.240
DŌMO, Yamoto Koki-SAN.

09:19.700 --> 09:21.530
I am Silver KARASU.

09:23.950 --> 09:27.210
Now show me your skills.

09:31.710 --> 09:34.880
Silver KARASU is a cowardly NINJA.

09:34.880 --> 09:38.010
He's killed hundreds of innocent people,

09:38.010 --> 09:41.720
who had no idea how to fight,
just to make a living.

09:50.230 --> 09:52.070
That attack was meaningless.

09:54.530 --> 09:55.740
Yes.

09:55.740 --> 09:57.070
Your KATANA.

09:57.070 --> 09:58.450
Swing your KATANA.

09:59.820 --> 10:00.990
YEEART!

10:29.940 --> 10:32.690
Stupid girl... Why are you crying?

10:33.730 --> 10:35.400
YEEART!

10:43.950 --> 10:45.240
You'll break it.

10:45.870 --> 10:47.950
YEEART!

10:47.950 --> 10:50.710
Hey... Stop this.

10:50.710 --> 10:52.330
I'm trying to give you...

10:52.330 --> 10:53.670
...your last...

10:54.630 --> 10:56.170
What?

10:56.880 --> 10:58.670
I'm running out of time.

11:13.860 --> 11:16.270
If you know who I am,

11:16.270 --> 11:18.480
you ain't gonna learn anything.

11:18.990 --> 11:21.150
We need to try to kill each other.

11:21.150 --> 11:22.660
I can't do that!

11:23.820 --> 11:26.080
I could tell it was you!

11:27.120 --> 11:28.950
I can't do it!

11:28.950 --> 11:31.000
You can't, huh?

11:31.000 --> 11:32.330
I can't...

11:33.500 --> 11:34.670
I see.

11:35.590 --> 11:38.050
I guess it was too much to hope for, huh?

11:38.800 --> 11:40.920
You're still a kid.

11:42.090 --> 11:43.550
In the end...

11:43.550 --> 11:46.140
I guess I never did get a cigarette.

11:47.510 --> 11:49.470
This must be my INGAŌHŌ.

11:50.850 --> 11:52.940
I guess that's...

11:52.940 --> 11:54.400
...my only regret.

11:56.150 --> 11:58.020
That's thanks to you.

11:58.860 --> 12:01.490
I'll shut up and go to Hell now.

13:46.380 --> 13:50.090
A train is passing through.

13:50.890 --> 13:55.430
If you are hit, it will inconvenience others.
